  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.4.7 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix: highlight consecutive SQL keywords by @jesko2004 in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/344\n* Bump rustls from 0.23.31 to 0.23.45 in the cargo group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/346\n* clean up tests by @achristmascarl in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/349\n* Bump rustls from 0.23.45 to 0.23.46 in the cargo group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/350\n* docs: remove stale x11/wayland clipboard note by @blurskye in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/353\n* upgrade duckdb, handle cancellations by @achristmascarl in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/352\n* fix: treat EXPLAIN (ANALYZE) writes like EXPLAIN ANALYZE by @blurskye in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/351\n* chore: update keyring to v4 by @omjadas in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/356\n* switch to single secrets value on linux and mac os by @achristmascarl in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/357\n\n## New Contributors\n* @jesko2004 made their first contribution in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/344\n* @blurskye made their first contribution in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/353\n* @omjadas made their first contribution in https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/pull/356\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/achristmascarl/rainfrog/compare/v0.4.6...v0.4.7",
